-- Row il-56. EXPECTED RED: nine assertions, all failing: two for I1, two for I2, two for I3 and three for I4. The count (9) is declared in check.sh and in encoding.json.
-- Each states what the printed words need. Nothing here is edited to make it pass.

§ `I1: one signature line prints two dates that name two days`

-- 1. The Hebrew date and the Gregorian date printed on the signature line name one day.
#ASSERT `the two dates on the line name one day` (`date line: the signature line, KT 11420 p. 3287`)
-- 2. The Gregorian date printed is the day the Hebrew date falls on, so the difference is 0 days (it is 10).
#ASSERT `the days from the day by the routine to the Gregorian date printed` (`date line: the signature line, KT 11420 p. 3287`) EQUALS 0

§ `I2: a deeming sentence points at a reporting method the chapter does not have`

-- 3. The citing words point at what the target is.
#ASSERT `the citation points at what it says` (`reference: the deeming in s 38לז(ד) to a bimonthly reporting method`)
-- 4. The target has the one bimonthly reporting method that the citing words name (it has 0).
#ASSERT `the target has everything the citing words name` (`reference: the deeming in s 38לז(ד) to a bimonthly reporting method`)

§ `I3: an indexation clause leaves two questions open`

-- 5. The clause names an organ that publishes the updated amounts (it names none).
#ASSERT `the clause names an organ that publishes the updated amounts` (`clause: the annual update in s 38נד`)
-- 6. The clause says which amounts a claim for damage before the first update day uses (it does not).
#ASSERT (`clause: the annual update in s 38נד`)'s `the clause says which amounts a claim for damage before the first update day uses`

§ `I4: a power names one kind of instrument and a rate, and the instrument made under it differs`

-- 7. The instrument is the kind of instrument the power names (the power names a notice, the instrument is regulations).
#ASSERT `the instrument is the kind of instrument the power names` (`power: s 2א(ב), to change the rate in s 2א(א)`) (`instrument: the regulations on KT 11193 p. 1886`)
-- 8. The instrument was signed before the tax year 2024 began (it was signed on 6 March 2024, after 1 January 2024).
#ASSERT `the instrument was signed before the tax year began` (`instrument: the regulations on KT 11193 p. 1886`) (`rate: tax year 2024, set by the regulations on KT 11193 p. 1886`)
-- 9. The instrument sets one figure for each base the statutory rate is set on (one figure for two bases).
#ASSERT `the instrument sets one figure for each base the statutory rate is set on` (`power: s 2א(ב), to change the rate in s 2א(א)`) (`rate: tax year 2024, set by the regulations on KT 11193 p. 1886`)
